  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u1-v1",
      "text": "三月壬午朔日，皇帝到泰州。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "b4859f520032f3243cfdc4f8d14e8702508213089d36107fe6cf6789cae838cb",
      "originalEnd": 10,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u2-v1",
      "text": "丁亥，再到广陵。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "da93522fc95934a062a82747bb24d5bc926ba4a2f8144de1c97b36d09b396f88",
      "originalEnd": 18,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 10,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u3-v1",
      "text": "辛卯，到迎銮江口。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "13e9562c4e9b1f0d84f3e76d9c6ccc1317eff613df88be8e931a9c48e038bf01",
      "originalEnd": 27,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 18,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u4-v1",
      "text": "派右武卫大将军李继勋率水军到江岛察敌。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "fc27b5cf6cdff07996fc67c8d3f94430cc50d1f4f47986841be049d58185678c",
      "originalEnd": 47,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 27,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u5-v1",
      "text": "癸巳，临江见敌船数十，命赵匡胤率战船追，敌退，赵匡胤直抵南岸，烧营栅返。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "882619df2930ef63ce9d8d7199a9664f955718037e0cb9ed8a53f87e25ad144d",
      "originalEnd": 90,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 47,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u6-v1",
      "text": "甲午，李继勋为左领军上将军。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1ccdd6372682cc1967e50e913721a0164efa15b1649b0fbe7df2e2440b2b7fcf",
      "originalEnd": 111,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 90,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u7-v1",
      "text": "乙未，殿前都虞候慕容延钊奏报在东㳍州大破敌军。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "63ea4e846f5c5f9a87bf64d8e94b0a9a1c2d541d375badd9325fb35481d2392a",
      "originalEnd": 134,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 111,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u8-v1",
      "text": "丙申，李景派兵部侍郎陈觉奉表陈情，贡罗、縠、䌷、绢三千匹，乳茶三千斤及香药、犀角象牙等。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "073e973e6cf450faf69325e9aff7215de0a33f1748ec643fcc56499e2bd61b79",
      "originalEnd": 178,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 134,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u9-v1",
      "text": "陈觉到行在，见楼船、战船泊江岸，以为天降，惊骇。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2004cd8ed16f5d81f214f4213ec687ff695e1765bc716c8c13d7828dbb8c6354",
      "originalEnd": 206,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 178,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u10-v1",
      "text": "丁酉，高保融奏报本道水军已到鄂州。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "6b3daedec9c934836ce2ef2e2a8d89c1f19379078fe8f67f0da5cb94d8a47d6a",
      "originalEnd": 225,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 206,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u11-v1",
      "text": "戊戌，钱俶报战船四百、水军一万七千已泊江岸，请定出师日期。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "c9fd584cf0ccf5775278f0c393a4c1a3403891d485f6681127f9832b1afed39e",
      "originalEnd": 258,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 225,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u12-v1",
      "text": "己亥，赵匡胤率水军在瓜步破敌船一百多。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "030c52d7e572064100c508027d1c191ff9827f8b6338c9c83e78a7fcbc50ba63",
      "originalEnd": 276,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 258,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u13-v1",
      "text": "当日李景派刘承遇上表献庐、舒、蕲、黄四州，请以江为界。皇帝回信：‘皇帝恭问江南国主。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1b1051988544b09f3ff21a4b11fda3b69797069955bdd6b4c28690fa601a9227",
      "originalEnd": 324,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 276,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u14-v1",
      "text": "使来，阅奏献舒、庐、蕲、黄、以江为界。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "b981a4804ee2e4d76d4f3c52d2b589faafa9a760686f70ebce0874a4e8d9c69f",
      "originalEnd": 349,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 324,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u15-v1",
      "text": "此前遇到许多变故，未能通好；近几年又爆发战事，双方交战不止，百姓因此受害很多。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "c9fb459c62d48df59f09b2bc44414b32ccd532e66e074f1e5728f842245a92b3",
      "originalEnd": 389,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 349,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u16-v1",
      "text": "最近使者再来，重陈前意，要保长久之约，须详说。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "32f788a4fd5ac9a42d969b5016aa8888c6f1666f7265830175f293f48d5a4458",
      "originalEnd": 411,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 389,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u17-v1",
      "text": "现在刘承遇来，封信又至，献州郡、定疆界，诚誓已明，始终之意已知。能如此，又求什么？",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "7c09a62815f67bbd7bdb4ce522598434209912e77d86bb1e422afaf77c07f1b9",
      "originalEnd": 457,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 411,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u18-v1",
      "text": "边境顿息战尘，军队便还京，我很欣慰。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "37c607c8b2183d31704a920382ddb99654f12bae5840b970e995419752f2c547",
      "originalEnd": 483,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 457,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u19-v1",
      "text": "常、润一路及沿江战船已令撤退；两浙、荆南、湖南水陆兵各罢；庐、黄、蕲三路将士也撤近内地，等你们迁走各处将领和军人家属，再派人召回留下的将校，交割城池。’",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "af0d9a294a79fe917730483e593fe8c5a6408129d7e71950881b1dc6d1d08aa4",
      "originalEnd": 574,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 483,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u20-v1",
      "text": "淮南平，共得十四州、六十县、二十二万六千五百七十四户。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "b854a61699016ce4bd9df078b230feb16c154a510454e76c187dda855e0b6fe3",
      "originalEnd": 601,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 574,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u21-v1",
      "text": "此前李景因江南危急，想传位世子，让他附庸于周，派陈觉表述。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "73ee8b7a3273e06ed3f6f5034445eac189c504826b6f2a155282a8ccc4ac9a20",
      "originalEnd": 635,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 601,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u22-v1",
      "text": "皇帝既允友好，回信：‘又阅来章，详陈辞位意、清高之怀。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f30b3436f71100320bd108c72c9f7b40e9f9fcc0c296c8772c71d649ef87cab8",
      "originalEnd": 681,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 635,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u23-v1",
      "text": "又提到近几年来的情况。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "61b0a071f2708c6d93617ba6f54de628ee32eeb6d7f9a92cf0fb7e0b63a60b67",
      "originalEnd": 688,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "底本在“仍以數歲已還”后以句号断开，语意下接下一原句的“交兵不息”；此处按原文句号单独展示，不改动底本。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 681,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u24-v1",
      "text": "双方交战不断，详尽谈及后悔之事，无非都是自责之辞。即使古人引咎自责、因灾害而心生戒惧，也没有超过这种程度的。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1806f2fec17d05c6753a5a77b0a1cc4b6d11396266cb299b982140ad049b5837",
      "originalEnd": 728,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 688,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u25-v1",
      "text": "况你精力正盛、年富力强，是一方英主，得民心。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "bdb65ea4d6c7ca0e3aa88042e1cc79296c9e5cb3414da09f526e88ee7d949b3a",
      "originalEnd": 754,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
