    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u26-v1",
      "text": "南北刚通、疆界初定，正是礼物往来、战争停止之初，怎可高辞君位、轻弃世务？与其慕清静，不如行安民济世之心。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "3dbd05dea587ad66b943a991ad7fed5f396c51a8ae11cea3f66ac6ee0cfd80b1",
      "originalEnd": 810,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 754,
