      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u27-v1",
      "text": "天灾流行、各地常有，前代贤人也不能免。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "5fa3d1db57ef525eeb9530751253021fa09c63c3e1886398017126968c19904b",
      "originalEnd": 831,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 810,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u28-v1",
      "text": "如德日日更新，福更长远，努力修政、勿怠治理，始终守高义，为家国留长远计，流芳留福，岂不美好！’庚子，诏说：‘近年贡举因循，屡令有司精试，望去留不滥、优劣分明。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d08718b2c291042ccb012ef4cad35f69d6e1b6edcb93ea7b199200c5761b4df3",
      "originalEnd": 921,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 831,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u29-v1",
      "text": "今年及第者文章有好坏，命文臣复核，免混杂。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "fb2ffc2c28293e58b5a218fbc56e4078aa4c0dff19c15cb8033dc30bd41453bb",
      "originalEnd": 969,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 921,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u30-v1",
      "text": "刘坦、战贻庆、李颂、徐纬、张觐诗赋稍优，准及第；王汾文辞仍未精当，念他先前曾落第，特准成名；熊若谷、陈保衡都是远人，深可怜惜，也准；郭峻、赵保雍、杨丹、安元度、张昉、董咸则、杜思道学习未够刻苦，都退黜，再修学待来年。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1a8ac320a73edef48c159ca296e0dc9477d91351970077c3a9a28f4055a2bccc",
      "originalEnd": 1087,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "“剥落”用于此处科举语境，指此前被黜落、未能及第，不是革除官职。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 969,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u31-v1",
      "text": "知贡举、右谏议大夫刘涛选士不当，贬右赞善大夫，令省过以戒任官者。’",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "6ef3670b5c8872effdef1c4d8fb5f2f1a1c2a6f144c18338e143ff92c01a3123",
      "originalEnd": 1127,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 1087,
