      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u32-v1",
      "text": "此前刘涛在东京放榜，带刘坦等十五人到行在，皇帝命翰林学士李昉覆试，故如此。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "14296c6073fb83212169a5e74d22336406c302fb4abd19d7e469ce371cd76510",
      "originalEnd": 1172,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 1127,
      "originalSha256": "b6779ae162f91a69e2d0d2a95961ee80b88356abaf5455445a99084e6ada509c",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "6834",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "4e5cf850ab431c708ab69be9e26cc4899a0ce1ba1af1e3923b3a66f1c31eff30",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v118-p3-u33-v1",
      "text": "壬寅，再到扬州，庐州军额改保信军。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "b14af2f41528647a73c030b971a517d23730d2af6ce89b5a41d11edac712669b",
      "originalEnd": 1190,
      "paragraphId": "old-v118-p3",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 1172,
